    "body": "I agree that the manifest seems like a big issue unless we block loading the web page on the manifest downloading.\r\n\r\nI'm unsure why this mapping is necessary, instead of separately specifying them as all accepted: `accept=\"foo/bar, .foo, .svg\"`. This seems like it would give equivalent functionality for file input and drag and drop. But I may be missing something.",
